  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: \r\nIntensity $\\mathrm{I} \\propto \\frac{1}{\\text { d }}$\r\nand photo-electric current $\\propto$ intensity\r\n$\\therefore$ Current will decrease",
